title>Genetic regulation of immune responses to vaccines in early life.</article-title><source>Genes Immun</source><volume>5</volume><fpage>122</fpage><lpage>129</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14737096</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0003485-Weir1"><label>20</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Weir</surname><given-names>RE</given-names></name><name><surname>Black</surname><given-names>GF</given-names></name><name><surname>Nazareth</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Floyd</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Stenson</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>The influence of previous exposure to environmental mycobacteria on the interferon-gamma response to bacille Calmette-Gu&#x000e9;rin vaccination in southern England and northern Malawi.</article-title><volume>146</volume><fpage>390</fpage><lpage>399</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0003485-Davids1"><label>21</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Davids</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Hanekom</surname><given-names>WA</given-names></name><name><surname>Mansoor</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Gamieldien</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Gelderbloem</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2006</year><article-title>The effect of bacille Calmette-Gu&#x000e9;rin vaccine strain and route of administration on induced immune responses in vaccinated infants.</article-title><source>J Infect Dis</source><volume>193</volume><fpage>531</fpage><lpage>536</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16425132</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0003485-Marchant1"><label>22</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Marchant</surname><given-name